                                "sense_id": "92d80e0b-1d87-3da0-8418-86f6f7c36a4c",
                                "text": "The chouquette clung to the most secret membranes of my palate, its sensual softness embraced my cheeks, its indecent elasticity caused it to congeal immediately in a homogeneous and unctuous paste which the sweetness of the sugar enhanced with a hint of perfection."
                            },
